    "text": "# FSSAI FoSCoS\n\n## Source\n\nOrganization: Food Safety and Standards Authority of India\n\nDocument Title: Food Business Services / FoSCoS\n\nOfficial URL: https://foscos.fssai.gov.in/\n\nSource Type: Government Digital Service\n\n## Content\n\nFSSAI provides food business services through the Food Safety Compliance System (FoSCoS).\n\nThe platform provides services for applying for a new food licence or registration.\n\nThe platform also provides facilities for tracking applications, renewing registrations or licences, modifying existing applications and managing food business compliance.\n\nThe FSSAI food business service portal provides access to licensing and registration services and related guidance documents.\n\nThe FoSCoS system is the pan-India platform used for food business licensing and registrati",
